{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: LLM基础MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LLM 模型选型（GPT-4/Claude/Llama/DeepSeek）的依据是什么？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LLM基础与Prompt工程\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/LLM基础\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"LLM 模型选型（GPT-4/Claude/Llama/DeepSeek）的依据是什么？\" dir=\"auto\">LLM 模型选型（GPT-4/Claude/Llama/DeepSeek）的依据是什么？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">GPT、Claude、Llama、DeepSeek 等模型各有什么特点？如何根据业务场景选择合适的模型？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、主流模型选型速查表</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选型角度</th>\n<th>推荐模型</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Agent / 工具调用 / 长任务稳定</td>\n<td>Claude (Anthropic)</td>\n<td>工具调用稳定，长 CoT 准确率高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通用 + 生态最广 + 多模态</td>\n<td>GPT-4o (OpenAI)</td>\n<td>生态最完善，Function Calling 成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超长上下文 / 多模态</td>\n<td>Gemini (Google)</td>\n<td>2M 上下文窗口，多模态原生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开源 + 微调研究的事实标准</td>\n<td>Llama (Meta)</td>\n<td>社区生态最丰富，论文基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开源 + 推理 / 代码 / 数学</td>\n<td>DeepSeek</td>\n<td>推理能力强，成本低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中文场景 / 国内私有化</td>\n<td>Qwen (阿里)</td>\n<td>中文理解好，开源可商用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中文长文档 / 阅读理解</td>\n<td>Kimi (Moonshot)</td>\n<td>200K 长上下文，中文优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻量 / 边缘 / 端侧部署</td>\n<td>Mistral / Phi / Gemma</td>\n<td>1B-7B 小模型，资源占用少</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、模型选型决策框架</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ModelSelectionFramework</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"模型选型决策框架\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    DECISION_TREE <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"是否需要私有化部署？\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"是\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"是否有充足 GPU 资源？\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"是\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Llama 3 / Qwen 2.5 / DeepSeek\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"否\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Qwen-7B / Mistral-7B (量化部署)\"</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"否\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 链路是否 &gt; 5 步？\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"是\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Claude Sonnet (工具调用稳定)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"否\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                        <span class=\"token string\">\"是否需要多模态？\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                            <span class=\"token string\">\"是\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"GPT-4o / Gemini\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                            <span class=\"token string\">\"否\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"GPT-4o-mini (性价比最高)\"</span>\n                        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n                    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">evaluate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> requirements<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"根据需求评估最佳模型\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> requirements<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"private_deployment\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> requirements<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpu_budget\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"llama-3.1-70b\"</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"qwen-2.5-7b-int4\"</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> requirements<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"agent_steps\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"claude-sonnet-4\"</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4o-mini\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三、实际选型案例</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>选型</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>企业内部 Agent，链路 10 步+</td>\n<td>Claude Sonnet</td>\n<td>工具调用更稳定，长链路准确率高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAG + 长文档问答</td>\n<td>Kimi / Gemini</td>\n<td>长上下文成本比切片好控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规私有化部署</td>\n<td>Qwen / DeepSeek</td>\n<td>可本地部署，数据不出域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学术研究微调实验</td>\n<td>Llama 3</td>\n<td>生态丰富，论文对比基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IoT / 浏览器端</td>\n<td>Phi-3 / Gemma-2B</td>\n<td>小模型，推理速度快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"为什么 Agent 场景推荐 Claude？\"</strong> — Claude 的工具调用（Function Calling）在长链路中稳定性更高，幻觉率更低</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"开源模型和闭源模型怎么选？\"</strong> — 有数据隐私要求选开源，追求效果上限选闭源</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}